    <h1>🌿 BLOOMORA 🌿</h1>
    <h3>“Turning Dreams into Green Spaces.”</h3>

    <h1>Employee Handbook</h1>

    <h2>1. 🌱 Welcome to Bloomora</h2>

    <p>
        Welcome to Bloomora, a green décor and plant-solutions company
        dedicated to transforming ordinary spaces into beautiful,
        refreshing, and eco-friendly environments.
    </p>

    <p>
        Bloomora provides creative plant arrangements, customized green
        décor, and plant-related solutions for homes, offices, commercial
        spaces, events, and other environments.
    </p>

    <p>
        Our employees are an important part of Bloomora's growth.
        Every employee contributes through creativity, teamwork,
        responsibility, and quality service.
    </p>


    <h2>2. 🌿 Vision, Mission & Core Values</h2>

    <h3>👁️ Vision</h3>

    <p>
        To create greener, healthier, and more beautiful spaces by
        bringing people closer to nature.
    </p>

    <h3>🎯 Mission</h3>

    <p>
        Bloomora aims to provide innovative and customized green décor
        solutions while encouraging sustainable and environmentally
        friendly practices.
    </p>

    <h3>💚 Core Values</h3>

    <ul>
        <li>🌱 Sustainability</li>
        <li>💡 Creativity</li>
        <li>⭐ Quality</li>
        <li>🤝 Teamwork</li>
        <li>😊 Customer Satisfaction</li>
        <li>💼 Professionalism</li>
    </ul>


    <h2>3. 👩‍💼 Employee Roles & Responsibilities</h2>

    <p>
        Every employee at Bloomora is expected to perform their assigned
        duties responsibly and contribute to the success of the company.
    </p>

    <h3>Employees should:</h3>

    <ul>
        <li>⏰ Complete assigned work on time.</li>
        <li>📋 Follow instructions from supervisors.</li>
        <li>⭐ Maintain the quality of their work.</li>
        <li>🤝 Communicate clearly with team members.</li>
        <li>🌱 Take proper care of plants and equipment.</li>
        <li>🧹 Maintain cleanliness in the workplace.</li>
        <li>⚠️ Report problems or damages.</li>
        <li>😊 Treat customers and colleagues respectfully.</li>
        <li>📌 Follow company rules and safety procedures.</li>
    </ul>


    <h2>4. ⏰ Working Hours, Attendance & Leave</h2>

    <p>
        Employees are expected to follow the working hours assigned
        to their particular role.
    </p>

    <h3>📅 Attendance</h3>

    <ul>
        <li>⏰ Report to work on time.</li>
        <li>📅 Maintain regular attendance.</li>
        <li>📞 Inform the supervisor about absence.</li>
        <li>🚫 Avoid unnecessary late arrivals.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>🏖️ Leave</h3>

    <p>
        Employees who require leave should apply through the appropriate
        procedure. Emergency leave should be communicated to the supervisor
        as soon as possible.
    </p>


    <h2>5. 🤝 Workplace Rules & Code of Conduct</h2>

    <p>
        Bloomora expects every employee to maintain professional and
        respectful behaviour.
    </p>

    <h3>✅ Employees should:</h3>

    <ul>
        <li>😊 Treat everyone with respect.</li>
        <li>🤍 Maintain honesty and integrity.</li>
        <li>💬 Use polite and professional language.</li>
        <li>📋 Follow workplace instructions.</li>
        <li>🧼 Maintain workplace hygiene.</li>
        <li>🤝 Work cooperatively with others.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>❌ Employees should not:</h3>

    <ul>
        <li>🚫 Steal or misuse company property.</li>
        <li>🌱 Damage plants or company materials.</li>
        <li>🔒 Share confidential information.</li>
        <li>📄 Falsify company records.</li>
        <li>⚠️ Engage in abusive behaviour.</li>
    </ul>


    <h2>6. 🪴 Health, Safety & Plant Care</h2>

    <p>
        Safety is an important responsibility for every Bloomora employee,
        especially those involved in plant handling, maintenance,
        transportation, and installation.
    </p>

    <h3>🦺 Safety Practices</h3>

    <ul>
        <li>🪴 Carry plants and pots carefully.</li>
        <li>🛠️ Handle gardening tools properly.</li>
        <li>🌱 Handle soil and plant-care materials safely.</li>
        <li>🚚 Take care while transporting plants.</li>
        <li>🏡 Follow safety procedures at customer locations.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>🌱 Plant Care</h3>

    <ul>
        <li>💧 Proper watering</li>
        <li>☀️ Appropriate sunlight</li>
        <li>🌱 Suitable soil</li>
        <li>🧪 Proper nutrients</li>
        <li>✂️ Regular pruning</li>
        <li>🧹 Cleaning of leaves</li>
        <li>🐛 Pest management</li>
    </ul>


    <h2>7. 💚 Customer Service & Communication</h2>

    <p>
        Customers are an important part of Bloomora's business.
        Employees are expected to provide friendly, professional,
        and reliable service.
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li>👋 Greet customers politely.</li>
        <li>👂 Listen carefully to customer requirements.</li>
        <li>📝 Understand customer needs.</li>
        <li>💬 Explain services clearly.</li>
        <li>✅ Provide accurate information.</li>
        <li>🤝 Handle complaints professionally.</li>
        <li>🏡 Respect customer property.</li>
    </ul>


    <h2>8. 🔒 Company Property, Confidentiality & Social Media</h2>

    <p>
        Bloomora's property includes plants, pots, gardening tools,
        décor materials, computers, documents, vehicles, and other
        company resources.
    </p>

    <p>
        Employees should use company property carefully and only for
        authorized purposes.
    </p>

    <h3>🔐 Confidentiality</h3>

    <ul>
        <li>👤 Customer details</li>
        <li>💰 Pricing information</li>
        <li>🚚 Supplier details</li>
        <li>📊 Business plans</li>
        <li>📄 Internal documents</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>📱 Social Media</h3>

    <p>
        Employees should not share confidential company information,
        private customer information, or internal documents on social
        media without authorization.
    </p>


    <h2>9. 📈 Performance, Training & Employee Growth</h2>

    <p>
        Bloomora believes that employee development contributes to
        the growth of the company.
    </p>

    <h3>⭐ Performance Evaluation</h3>

    <ul>
        <li>⭐ Quality of work</li>
        <li>📊 Productivity</li>
        <li>⏰ Attendance and punctuality</li>
        <li>😊 Customer service</li>
        <li>🤝 Teamwork</li>
        <li>💬 Communication</li>
        <li>💡 Creativity</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>🎓 Training</h3>

    <ul>
        <li>🌱 Plant identification and care</li>
        <li>🎨 Green décor and arrangement</li>
        <li>😊 Customer service</li>
        <li>💬 Communication</li>
        <li>🦺 Workplace safety</li>
        <li>📦 Inventory management</li>
    </ul>


    <h2>10. 🏡 Employee Welfare, Grievances & Disciplinary Procedures</h2>

    <p>
        Bloomora believes that employees should work in a safe,
        respectful, supportive, and positive environment.
    </p>

    <h3>❤️ Employee Welfare</h3>

    <ul>
        <li>🤝 Healthy teamwork</li>
        <li>😊 Positive workplace relationships</li>
        <li>🌱 Professional development</li>
        <li>🦺 Workplace safety</li>
        <li>⚖️ Fair treatment</li>
        <li>💬 Open communication</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>📢 Employee Grievances</h3>

    <p>
        Employees can communicate their workplace concerns to their
        immediate supervisor or the appropriate management representative.
    </p>

    <h3>⚠️ Disciplinary Action</h3>

    <ul>
        <li>🗣️ Verbal warning</li>
        <li>📝 Written warning</li>
        <li>🔄 Corrective measures</li>
        <li>⚖️ Further disciplinary action when appropriate</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>🚪 Resignation & Exit</h3>

    <ul>
        <li>📋 Complete pending responsibilities.</li>
        <li>🤝 Hand over important work.</li>
        <li>🏢 Return company property.</li>
        <li>📄 Return documents or equipment.</li>
        <li>✅ Complete required exit procedures.</li>
    </ul>


    <h2>🌿 Bloomora's Promise</h2>

    <p>
        At Bloomora, we believe that when people grow, businesses grow.
        And when businesses grow responsibly, spaces become greener.
        🌱💚
    </p>

    <p>
        Together, we work towards
        <strong>turning dreams into green spaces.</strong> 🪴✨
    </p>

